    "title": "Jordan Clarkson gives the Knicks a reason to rethink the bench - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alexander Wilson ,\n11 hours ago\nJordan Clarkson didn’t play against Detroit. A night later, the Knicks needed every bit of the offense he gave them in Chicago. I wouldn’t make one strong appearance a promise of closing minutes. I would keep him in the rotation conversation, though, because New York’s bench needs a scorer who can change the pace when its starters stall.\nRead full article",
